{
  "story_id": "camel-and-the-well",
  "chapter": 3,
  "total_duration_ms": 384456,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Sidi stood up first.",
      "start_ms": 2073,
      "end_ms": 3575
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "He was covered in sand.",
      "start_ms": 3575,
      "end_ms": 5290
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "He shook himself.",
      "start_ms": 5290,
      "end_ms": 6577
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "He helped Nadia up.",
      "start_ms": 6577,
      "end_ms": 8007
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "She was also covered in sand.",
      "start_ms": 8007,
      "end_ms": 10152
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "She shook herself.",
      "start_ms": 10152,
      "end_ms": 11510
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Farouk stood up.",
      "start_ms": 11510,
      "end_ms": 12725
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "He gave himself a huge shake, and sand flew off him in a big cloud.",
      "start_ms": 12725,
      "end_ms": 17587
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "The dunes around them looked completely different.",
      "start_ms": 17587,
      "end_ms": 21233
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Every crest had a new shape.",
      "start_ms": 21233,
      "end_ms": 23306
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Any footprints they had left were gone.",
      "start_ms": 23306,
      "end_ms": 26165
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "There was no way to tell which way they had come.",
      "start_ms": 26165,
      "end_ms": 29740
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Nadia looked around.",
      "start_ms": 29740,
      "end_ms": 31241
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "She had no idea which way home was.",
      "start_ms": 31241,
      "end_ms": 33815
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "None.",
      "start_ms": 33815,
      "end_ms": 34244
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "She turned to Sidi.",
      "start_ms": 34244,
      "end_ms": 35745
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Sidi was looking too.",
      "start_ms": 35745,
      "end_ms": 37318
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "He was looking carefully.",
      "start_ms": 37318,
      "end_ms": 39177
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Then he said, quietly, \"Nadia.",
      "start_ms": 39177,
      "end_ms": 41393
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Listen.",
      "start_ms": 41393,
      "end_ms": 41965
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "I do not know which way home is either.",
      "start_ms": 41965,
      "end_ms": 44824
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "The storm changed everything.",
      "start_ms": 44824,
      "end_ms": 46969
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Also I am — I am not thinking as clearly as I usually do.",
      "start_ms": 46969,
      "end_ms": 51116
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Something in my chest is not right.",
      "start_ms": 51116,
      "end_ms": 53689
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "I got a shock when the storm came.",
      "start_ms": 53689,
      "end_ms": 56191
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "My heart is beating hard.",
      "start_ms": 56191,
      "end_ms": 58050
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "I need to sit and rest for a while.\" He sat back down.",
      "start_ms": 58050,
      "end_ms": 61982
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "He put a hand on his chest.",
      "start_ms": 61982,
      "end_ms": 63984
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "He was breathing carefully.",
      "start_ms": 63984,
      "end_ms": 65986
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "His face was slightly grey.",
      "start_ms": 65986,
      "end_ms": 67987
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Nadia was suddenly very frightened.",
      "start_ms": 67987,
      "end_ms": 70633
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "\"Sidi,\" she said.",
      "start_ms": 70633,
      "end_ms": 71919
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "\"What do we do.\" Sidi took a slow breath.",
      "start_ms": 71919,
      "end_ms": 74922
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "He looked up at her.",
      "start_ms": 74922,
      "end_ms": 76423
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "He said, \"Do you remember what I said.",
      "start_ms": 76423,
      "end_ms": 79211
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "About the camel.\" \"Yes,\" said Nadia.",
      "start_ms": 79211,
      "end_ms": 81857
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "\"Trust the camel.\" \"Yes,\" said Sidi.",
      "start_ms": 81857,
      "end_ms": 84502
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "\"Trust the camel.",
      "start_ms": 84502,
      "end_ms": 85788
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Farouk knows the way home.",
      "start_ms": 85788,
      "end_ms": 87719
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "He will walk there if we let him.",
      "start_ms": 87719,
      "end_ms": 90149
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "He has done this walk a thousand times.",
      "start_ms": 90149,
      "end_ms": 93009
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "He does not need me.",
      "start_ms": 93009,
      "end_ms": 94510
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Let him lead.",
      "start_ms": 94510,
      "end_ms": 95511
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Take the rope.",
      "start_ms": 95511,
      "end_ms": 96584
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Do not pull him.",
      "start_ms": 96584,
      "end_ms": 97799
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Do not try to steer him.",
      "start_ms": 97799,
      "end_ms": 99586
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Just — walk beside him.",
      "start_ms": 99586,
      "end_ms": 101302
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Whatever direction he goes, we go.\"",
      "start_ms": 101302,
      "end_ms": 103947
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Nadia was quiet for a moment.",
      "start_ms": 103947,
      "end_ms": 106092
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "She said, \"Can you walk, Sidi.\" Sidi said, \"I can walk.",
      "start_ms": 106092,
      "end_ms": 110095
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Slowly.",
      "start_ms": 110095,
      "end_ms": 110667
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "If you help me.",
      "start_ms": 110667,
      "end_ms": 111811
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "You take the camel.",
      "start_ms": 111811,
      "end_ms": 113241
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "I hold the camel with one hand and you with the other.",
      "start_ms": 113241,
      "end_ms": 117173
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Yes?\" Nadia said yes.",
      "start_ms": 117173,
      "end_ms": 118746
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "She helped him stand.",
      "start_ms": 118746,
      "end_ms": 120318
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "She took the lead rope.",
      "start_ms": 120318,
      "end_ms": 122034
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "She put her other hand on Sidi's arm.",
      "start_ms": 122034,
      "end_ms": 124751
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Sidi held Farouk's saddle.",
      "start_ms": 124751,
      "end_ms": 126681
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "And she said to Farouk, in a small voice, \"All right, Farouk.",
      "start_ms": 126681,
      "end_ms": 131113
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Take us home.",
      "start_ms": 131113,
      "end_ms": 132114
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Please.\" And Farouk — after a moment of standing still, considering — turned his big head slightly to the north and began to walk.",
      "start_ms": 132114,
      "end_ms": 141408
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "They walked for a very long time.",
      "start_ms": 141408,
      "end_ms": 143754
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Farouk did not walk fast.",
      "start_ms": 143754,
      "end_ms": 145548
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "He walked at the pace of Sidi, which was slow.",
      "start_ms": 145548,
      "end_ms": 148792
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "He walked up dunes and down them.",
      "start_ms": 148792,
      "end_ms": 151138
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Sometimes he took a route Nadia would never have chosen — around a large dune when it would have been shorter to go over it, or up a steep face when it looked like the wrong direction.",
      "start_ms": 151138,
      "end_ms": 163904
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "But Nadia did not pull on the rope.",
      "start_ms": 163904,
      "end_ms": 166388
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "She did not try to change his mind.",
      "start_ms": 166388,
      "end_ms": 168872
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "She just walked beside him.",
      "start_ms": 168872,
      "end_ms": 170804
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "She kept one hand on his rope and one hand on Sidi's arm.",
      "start_ms": 170804,
      "end_ms": 174807
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "She could feel Sidi getting tired.",
      "start_ms": 174807,
      "end_ms": 177291
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "\"Sidi,\" she said, after maybe an hour.",
      "start_ms": 177291,
      "end_ms": 179982
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "\"Do you need to rest.\" \"Yes,\" said Sidi.",
      "start_ms": 179982,
      "end_ms": 182811
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "\"But we should keep going.",
      "start_ms": 182811,
      "end_ms": 184675
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "If I sit now, I will not want to get up.\" So they kept going.",
      "start_ms": 184675,
      "end_ms": 188953
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Nadia talked to him a little as they walked, to keep him awake and talking.",
      "start_ms": 188953,
      "end_ms": 194197
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "She told him about her school.",
      "start_ms": 194197,
      "end_ms": 196336
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "She told him about her friends.",
      "start_ms": 196336,
      "end_ms": 198545
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "She told him about the movie she had watched with her mother the week before.",
      "start_ms": 198545,
      "end_ms": 203927
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "She was making it up as she went.",
      "start_ms": 203927,
      "end_ms": 206273
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "She did not remember much of what she said.",
      "start_ms": 206273,
      "end_ms": 209310
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "She just kept talking.",
      "start_ms": 209310,
      "end_ms": 210897
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Sidi answered sometimes.",
      "start_ms": 210897,
      "end_ms": 212622
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "Sometimes he only nodded.",
      "start_ms": 212622,
      "end_ms": 214485
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "It was almost sunset when they came up over a dune and Nadia saw, at the base of the next slope, the first buildings of Merzouga.",
      "start_ms": 214485,
      "end_ms": 223456
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "She almost cried.",
      "start_ms": 223456,
      "end_ms": 224698
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "She had been walking for two and a half hours next to a camel through empty dunes, and she had honestly not been sure they would get there.",
      "start_ms": 224698,
      "end_ms": 234359
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "She stopped and put both her arms around Farouk's big neck.",
      "start_ms": 234359,
      "end_ms": 238499
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "She pressed her face against his fur.",
      "start_ms": 238499,
      "end_ms": 241121
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "He smelled of sand and warm hair and dust.",
      "start_ms": 241121,
      "end_ms": 244088
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "She said, into his fur, \"Thank you, Farouk.",
      "start_ms": 244088,
      "end_ms": 247125
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "start_ms": 247125,
      "end_ms": 247884
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Thank you.\" Farouk did not move.",
      "start_ms": 247884,
      "end_ms": 250161
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "He let her hug him.",
      "start_ms": 250161,
      "end_ms": 251472
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "They came into the village in the last of the golden evening light.",
      "start_ms": 251472,
      "end_ms": 255618
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "People saw them and came running.",
      "start_ms": 255618,
      "end_ms": 257691
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "There was a lot of shouting.",
      "start_ms": 257691,
      "end_ms": 259459
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Sidi's neighbor, a strong young man named Youssef, took Sidi off the camel and helped him into the house.",
      "start_ms": 259459,
      "end_ms": 265922
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Someone ran to get the village nurse.",
      "start_ms": 265922,
      "end_ms": 268239
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Sidi was okay — he had had what the nurse said was a small heart episode, brought on by the shock of the storm, but he was going to recover.",
      "start_ms": 268239,
      "end_ms": 276836
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "He needed rest.",
      "start_ms": 276836,
      "end_ms": 277811
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "He would be fine in a few days.",
      "start_ms": 277811,
      "end_ms": 279823
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "That evening Nadia sat by Sidi's bed with a cup of mint tea.",
      "start_ms": 279823,
      "end_ms": 283543
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "He was very tired but he was awake.",
      "start_ms": 283543,
      "end_ms": 285738
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "He looked at her for a while without speaking.",
      "start_ms": 285738,
      "end_ms": 288603
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Then he said, \"You did a very brave thing today, Nadia.",
      "start_ms": 288603,
      "end_ms": 292018
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "You trusted the camel.",
      "start_ms": 292018,
      "end_ms": 293420
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Many people would not have.",
      "start_ms": 293420,
      "end_ms": 295127
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Many people would have panicked and tried to walk their own direction and would have gone the wrong way.",
      "start_ms": 295127,
      "end_ms": 301529
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "And I would have died in the desert.",
      "start_ms": 301529,
      "end_ms": 303785
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "And you would have died too.",
      "start_ms": 303785,
      "end_ms": 305553
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "So you saved us both today.",
      "start_ms": 305553,
      "end_ms": 307260
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "By listening to what I told you and by doing it.\"",
      "start_ms": 307260,
      "end_ms": 310248
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Nadia said, quietly, \"I was very afraid.\" \"Yes,\" said Sidi.",
      "start_ms": 310248,
      "end_ms": 314413
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "\"So was I.",
      "start_ms": 314413,
      "end_ms": 315177
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "That is what being brave is.",
      "start_ms": 315177,
      "end_ms": 317190
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "Being afraid, and doing the right thing anyway.\" He was quiet for a moment.",
      "start_ms": 317190,
      "end_ms": 322466
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "Then he said, \"Nadia.",
      "start_ms": 322466,
      "end_ms": 323993
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "I want to give you something.\" He reached into his robe.",
      "start_ms": 323993,
      "end_ms": 327950
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "He took out the small piece of paper he had had all day — the folded hand-drawn map with the eleven small crosses on it.",
      "start_ms": 327950,
      "end_ms": 336349
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "He held it out.",
      "start_ms": 336349,
      "end_ms": 337460
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "\"I want you to have this.\" Nadia said, \"But — Sidi.",
      "start_ms": 337460,
      "end_ms": 341070
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "You said only four people know.",
      "start_ms": 341070,
      "end_ms": 343291
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "That is not — I am not supposed to have this.\" Sidi smiled just a little.",
      "start_ms": 343291,
      "end_ms": 348428
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "He said, \"You are the fifth now.",
      "start_ms": 348428,
      "end_ms": 350719
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "It is a decision I am making.",
      "start_ms": 350719,
      "end_ms": 352801
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "You proved today that you can be trusted with something important.",
      "start_ms": 352801,
      "end_ms": 357452
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "And you are twelve.",
      "start_ms": 357452,
      "end_ms": 358841
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "You will live a long time.",
      "start_ms": 358841,
      "end_ms": 360715
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "Someday, someone in the village will need this map.",
      "start_ms": 360715,
      "end_ms": 364325
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "Keep it safe.",
      "start_ms": 364325,
      "end_ms": 365297
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Do not lose it.",
      "start_ms": 365297,
      "end_ms": 366407
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "When you are older, bring it back and show it to the two younger men.",
      "start_ms": 366407,
      "end_ms": 371267
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Tell them who taught you.",
      "start_ms": 371267,
      "end_ms": 373071
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "Yes?\" And Nadia took the small folded map.",
      "start_ms": 373071,
      "end_ms": 376056
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "She put it against her chest.",
      "start_ms": 376056,
      "end_ms": 378139
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "She said, quietly, \"Yes, Sidi.",
      "start_ms": 378139,
      "end_ms": 380291
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "I will keep it safe.\" And she did, for the rest of her life.",
      "start_ms": 380291,
      "end_ms": 384456
    }
  ]
}